Z||000001||artherd||11-28-2001||07:07 AM||||AWESOME!<P>Wow that motor looks great in that car, this is truely the next generation people! <P>Man those are some pretty headers!!!<P>I'm wondering how he got a 'left' side valve cover to attach to the 'right' of the motor, and how he's running withought the intake's top? (or did both of these change in later/earlier year models?)<P>Also can't figure out why he couldn't use the stock coolant crossover tube. (unless it was a severe space restriction?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.willburns.com/northstar/P5240003.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/northstar/northstar1.jpg"> <P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||14
